OL,3,AChildren among 139 dead after boat
OL,4,Acapsizes off Djibouti, UN says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 139 migrants including 15
OL,7,Fchildren have died and dozens more are
OL,8,Fstill missing after a boat sank off the
OL,9,Fcoast of Djibouti, the UN's migration
OL,10,Foffice has said.
OL,12,FThe boat had been travelling from
OL,13,FDjibouti to Yemen with 305 people
OL,14,Faboard when it capsized near the port
OL,15,Ftown of Obock on Thursday night. Around
OL,16,F82 people were rescued, the
OL,17,FInternational Organization for
OL,18,FMigration (IOM) said.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
