OL,3,AChildren among 139 dead after boat
OL,4,Acapsizes off Djibouti, UN says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIOM's Djibouti mission chief Alexandre
OL,7,FCoissac called the tragedy a "stark
OL,8,Freminder" of the dangers migrants face
OL,9,Fwhen seeking a new life elsewhere.
OL,11,FTens of thousands of migrants from the
OL,12,FHorn of Africa make the perilous
OL,13,Fjourney each year hoping to reach Gulf
OL,14,Fcountries for safety and work, the
OL,15,Fagency says.
